:"call_A1z1x4HxYHZsrVrfCrOFEnGI","toolName":"subagent","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Refactoring complete for `src/claim-office.ts`.\n\n**Naming evaluation**\n- `processScenario` accurately describes its purpose and was retained.\n- Renamed:\n  - `usedByType` → `matchedDamageCountByType`\n  - `occurrence` → `coveredItemIndex`\n- These names clarify occurrence-based matching between damages and covered items.\n\n**Simple Design**\n1. Tests pass before and after.\n2. Intent improved through clearer matching terminology.\n3. No safe duplication removal identified.\n4. No new elements or abstractions introduced.\n\n**APP mass — refactored matching block**\n- Constants: 2 = 2\n- Bindings: 6 = 6\n- Invocations/operators: 6 = 12\n- Conditionals: 0\n- Iterations (`reduce`, `filter`): 2 = 10\n- Assignments: 0\n\n**Mass:** 30 → 30 (delta 0). Clarity improved without increasing structural mass.\n\n**Tests:** 13 passed, 9 todo."}],"details":{"mode":"single","agentScope":"both","projectAgentsDir":"/home/experimenter/experiments/runs/2026-07-25_04-34-55_claim-office-example-mapping_v6.2-with-why-cleaned-pi_gpt-5-6-sol/.pi/agents","results":[{"agent":"refactor","agentSource":"project","task":"Test file: src/claim-office.spec.ts\nImplementation file: src/claim-office.ts\nPassing tests: 13\nRecent Green phase: Added occurrence-based covered-item matching and enchantment 8+ reimbursement.\n\nRefactor implementation while keeping all tests green. Run autonomously, return when done.","exitCode":0,"messages":[{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Task: Test file: src/claim-office.spec.ts\nImplementation file: src/claim-office.ts\nPassing tests: 13\nRecent Green phase: Added occurrence-based covered-item matching and enchantment 8+ reimbursement.\n\nRefactor implementation while keeping all tests green. Run autonomously, return when done."}],"timestamp":1784954341488},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_MUjBher3yRme5pTEUTIX1c3t","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"src/claim-office.ts"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_C3iaYZBezXXfGx58FOgiYjRp","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"src/claim-office.spec.ts"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_anddP6biB9oHl7dNFBc33jPd","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"package.json"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"requesty","model":"azure/gpt-5.6-sol@swedencentral","usage":{"input":474,"output":107,"cacheRead":5248,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":32,"totalTokens":5829,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1784954341510,"responseId":"rqsty-cmpl-20f03e79-d7d8-4b95-ac3b-b41c414bfd39","responseModel":"gpt-5.6-sol-2026-07-09"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_MUjBher3yRme5pTEUTIX1c3t","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"export interface Item {\n  type: string;\n  material?: string;\n  enchantment?: number;\n  cursed?: boolean;\n}\n\nexport interface QuoteStep {\n  op: \"quote\";\n  items: Item[];\n}\n\nexport interface Damage {\n  itemType: string;\n  amount: number;\n}\n\nexport interface ClaimStep {\n  op: \"claim\";\n  policy: number;\n  incident: { cause: string; damages: Damage[] };\n}\n\nexport interface Scenario {\n  customer: { yearsWithMHPCO: number };\n  steps: Array<QuoteStep | ClaimStep>;\n}\n\nconst PROCESSING_FEE = 5;\nconst INSURANCE_VALUE: Record<string, number> = {\n  sword: 1000, amulet: 600, staff: 800, potion: 400, rune: 250, moonstone: 250,\n};\nconst BASE_PREMIUM: Record<string, number> = {\n  sword: 100,\n  amulet: 60,\n  staff: 80,\n  potion: 40,\n  rune: 25,\n  moonstone: 25,\n};\n\nexport const processScenario = (scenario: Scenario): unknown => {\n  let completedQuoteCount = 0;\n  const policies = new Map<number, { items: Item[]; remainingCap: number }>();\n  return { results: scenario.steps.map((step, stepIndex) => {\n    if (step.op === \"quote\") {\n      let basePremium = step.items.reduce((sum, item) => sum + BASE_PREMIUM[item.type], 0);\n      for (const component of [\"rune\", \"moonstone\"]) {\n        if (step.items.filter((item) => item.type === component).length === 3) basePremium -= 15;\n      }\n      const riskSurcharge = step.items.reduce((sum, item) => {\n        const itemBase = BASE_PREMIUM[item.type];\n        return sum + (item.cursed ? itemBase / 2 : 0) + ((item.enchantment ?? 0) >= 5 ? itemBase * 3 / 10 : 0);\n      }, 0);\n      const loyaltyDiscount = scenario.customer.yearsWithMHPCO >= 2 ? basePremium / 5 : 0;\n      const followUpDiscount = completedQuoteCount > 0 ? basePremium * 15 / 100 : 0;\n      completedQuoteCount += 1;\n      policies.set(stepIndex, {\n        items: step.items,\n        remainingCap: step.items.reduce((sum, item) => sum + INSURANCE_VALUE[item.type] * 2, 0),\n      });\n      return { premium: Math.ceil(basePremium + riskSurcharge + basePremium / 10 - loyaltyDiscount - followUpDiscount + PROCESSING_FEE) };\n    }\n    const policy = policies.get(step.policy)!;\n    const usedByType = new Map<string, number>();\n    const desiredPayout = step.incident.damages.reduce((sum, damage) => {\n      const occurrence = usedByType.get(damage.itemType) ?? 0;\n      usedByType.set(damage.itemType, occurrence + 1);\n      const item = policy.items.filter((candidate) => candidate.type === damage.itemType)[occurrence];\n      const reimbursed = (item.enchantment ?? 0) >= 8 ? damage.amount / 2 : damage.amount;\n      return sum + Math.max(0, reimbursed - 100);\n    }, 0);\n    const payout = Math.min(desiredPayout, policy.remainingCap);\n    policy.remainingCap -= payout;\n    return { payout, remainingCap: policy.remainingCap };\n  }) };\n};\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1784954342830},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_C3iaYZBezXXfGx58FOgiYjRp","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"import { describe, expect, it } from \"vitest\";\nimport { processScenario, type Item, type Scenario } from \"./claim-office.js\";\n\nconst run = (scenario: Scenario) => processScenario(scenario);\n\nconst customer = (yearsWithMHPCO = 0) => ({ yearsWithMHPCO });\n\nconst quote = (items: Item[]) => ({ op: \"quote\" as const, items });\n\ndescribe(\"MHPCO claim office\", () => {\n  it(\"quotes an empty item list at 5 G for the processing fee only\", () => {\n    expect(run({ customer: customer(), steps: [quote([])] })).toEqual({\n      results: [{ premium: 5 }],\n    });\n  });\n  it(\"uses the price list for sword, amulet, staff, and potion premiums\", () => {\n    expect(run({ customer: customer(), steps: [\n      quote([{ type: \"sword\" }]), quote([{ type: \"amulet\" }]),\n      quote([{ type: \"staff\" }]), quote([{ type: \"potion\" }]),\n    ] })).toEqual({ results: [\n      { premium: 115 }, { premium: 62 }, { premium: 81 }, { premium: 43 },\n    ] });\n  });\n  it(\"prices component quantities 2, 3, 4, and 7 at 50, 60, 100, and 175 G before the fee\", () => {\n    const runes = (count: number): Item[] => Array.from({ length: count }, () => ({ type: \"rune\" }));\n    expect(run({ customer: customer(), steps: [quote(runes(2)), quote(runes(3)), quote(runes(4)), quote(runes(7))] })).toEqual({\n      results: [{ premium: 60 }, { premium: 62 }, { premium: 100 }, { premium: 172 }],\n    });\n  });\n  it(\"forms component blocks only from exactly three components of the same type\", () => {\n    const mixed = [{ type: \"rune\" }, { type: \"rune\" }, { type: \"moonstone\" }];\n    const twoBlocks = [...Array.from({ length: 3 }, () => ({ type: \"rune\" })), ...Array.from({ length: 3 }, () => ({ type: \"moonstone\" }))];\n    expect(run({ customer: customer(), steps: [quote(mixed), quote(twoBlocks)] })).toEqual({ results: [{ premium: 88 }, { premium: 119 }] });\n  });\n  it(\"applies cursed and high-enchantment modifiers at their exact thresholds only to affected items\", () => {\n    expect(run({ customer: customer(), steps: [\n      quote([{ type: \"sword\", cursed: true, enchantment: 4 }]),\n      quote([{ type: \"sword\", cursed: true, enchantment: 5 }]),\n      quote([{ type: \"sword\", enchantment: 5 }]),\n    ] })).toEqual({ results: [{ premium: 165 }, { premium: 180 }, { premium: 130 }] });\n  });\n  it(\"applies cursed item surcharge only to that item in a multi-item policy -- 231 G including fee\", () => {\n    expect(run({ customer: customer(), steps: [quote([{ type: \"sword\", cursed: true }, { type: \"amulet\" }])] })).toEqual({ results: [{ premium: 231 }] });\n  });\n  it(\"applies loyalty, first-insurance, and follow-up modifiers to the policy base premium\", () => {\n    expect(run({ customer: customer(3), steps: [quote([{ type: \"sword\" }]), quote([{ type: \"sword\" }])] })).toEqual({\n      results: [{ premium: 95 }, { premium: 80 }],\n    });\n  });\n  it(\"quotes a newcomer with a cursed sword at 165 G\", () => {\n    expect(run({ customer: customer(), steps: [quote([{ type: \"sword\", material: \"steel\", enchantment: 3, cursed: true }])] })).toEqual({ results: [{ premium: 165 }] });\n  });\n  it(\"quotes a long-standing customer's cursed enchanted sword on their second contract at 160 G\", () => {\n    expect(run({ customer: customer(3), steps: [quote([]), quote([{ type: \"sword\", material: \"steel\", enchantment: 7, cursed: true }])] })).toEqual({\n      results: [{ premium: 5 }, { premium: 160 }],\n    });\n  });\n  it(\"rounds a fractional 197.5 G premium up to 198 G only at the end\", () => {\n    expect(run({ customer: customer(), steps: [quote(Array.from({ length: 7 }, () => ({ type: \"rune\" })))] })).toEqual({ results: [{ premium: 198 }] });\n  });\n  it(\"reimburses ordinary sword and rune damage in full before one 100 G deductible each\", () => {\n    expect(run({ customer: customer(), steps: [\n      quote([{ type: \"sword\", material: \"steel\", enchantment: 3 }, { type: \"rune\" }]),\n      { op: \"claim\", policy: 0, incident: { cause: \"accident\", damages: [{ itemType: \"sword\", amount: 500 }, { itemType: \"rune\", amount: 200 }] } },\n    ] })).toEqual({ results: [{ premium: 143 }, { 